\multicolumn{2}{r}{100.0} \\ \cline{2-3}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{0.00} \\ \cline{2-2}
\end{array}$$
Thus, the decimal representation of $\frac{11}{125}$ is $\boxed{0.088}$.The answer is: 0.088

